@format 1
@id audio.restore-plan
@title Restore audio plan
@area Audio
@entry input
@summary Resolve saved and tab-persistent audio settings for the newly active source and apply them to the inspector and processing view.
@flow TB
@related audio.save-plan, queue.create-saved-audio-work

@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAudioTab
@alias audio = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LAudio

[input] Active audio source changes <input>
- Start plan restoration for the viewer's active source @ tab.PAudioPlanRestore(...)
> read

[read] Read plan sources <process>
- Read the source sidecar audio plan @ audio.LAudioPlanRead(...)
- Resolve saved values with tab-persistent values @ audio.LAudioPlanResolve(...)
> apply

[apply] Apply resolved plan <process>
- Apply resolved steps and skip state to the inspector @ tab.PAudioPlanRestore(...)
- Refresh the visible processing steps and active state @ tab.PAudioActiveUpdate(...)
> result

[result] Audio plan restored <output>
= The inspector and processing surface represent the resolved plan for the active source.
